OL,3,GNEWSAWoman whose XL bully dog killed
OL,4,Aher cousin given suspended prison
OL,5,Asentence
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman has been given a suspended
OL,8,Fprison sentence after an XL bully dog
OL,9,Fattacked and killed her cousin.
OL,11,FKelcie Reed, 24, of Bristol, previously
OL,12,Fadmitted being in charge of a dog
OL,13,Fdangerously out control, causing the
OL,14,Fdeath of Morgan Dorsett.
OL,16,FThe 19-year-old, from Shrewsbury, died
OL,17,Ffrom neck injuries caused by the
OL,18,Fattack, which happened at Reed's flat
OL,19,Fin south Bristol in February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
