OL,3,GNEWSAWoman whose XL bully dog killed
OL,4,Aher cousin given suspended prison
OL,5,Asentence
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt Bristol Crown Court, Judge Anna
OL,8,FRichardson sentenced Reed to 18 weeks
OL,9,Fin prison, suspended for 18 months. She
OL,10,Fwill also be required to undergo mental
OL,11,Fhealth treatment.
